  m_text: "Zargana, uzun ve ince yap\u0131s\u0131yla kolayca tan\u0131nan bir Akdeniz
    ve Karadeniz bal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Ye\u015Filimsi kemik yap\u0131s\u0131
    sayesinde di\u011Fer bal\u0131klardan ayr\u0131l\u0131r. Y\xFCzey sular\u0131nda
    h\u0131zl\u0131 y\xFCzerek avlan\u0131r."
